WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Distributor rotor
What it does: Directs high voltage in sequence to the cylinder output contacts.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Distributor rotor
How it works: Its tip approaches the contact for the intended cylinder.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Distributor rotor
How it moves: Turns with the camshaft: one revolution for every two crankshaft revolutions.
